ForgeCAD Fictional Energy Weapon MaterialPack 1.0.0

This development-only first-party pack is limited to legal, nonfunctional
fictional game, film and visualization assets. It does not contain weapon
manufacturing data or functional performance guidance.

The seven embedded texture source files are byte-identical copies of the
already-admitted CC0 ambientCG Metal010 and Plastic006 source selections used
by forgecad-hard-surface-robot@1.0.0. Their original source URLs, archive
hashes, license and derivation are retained in manifest.json and
provenance.json. ForgeCAD-specific material factors and semantic material
names are first-party metadata.
